OL,3,GNEWSASchools in lockdown and boy in
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo schools are in lockdown as armed
OL,7,Fpolice search for a group of people
OL,8,Finvolved in an altercation that left a
OL,9,Fboy injured.
OL,11,FOne male was seen with a "long-bladed
OL,12,Fitem" during the incident outside St
OL,13,FPeter's High School in Gloucester,
OL,14,Fpolice said.
OL,16,FArmed officers are now searching for a
OL,17,Fgroup involved who fled the area. The
OL,18,Fforce said one boy had been taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with minor injuries and there
OL,20,Fwas "no ongoing threat at the school".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
