OL,3,GNEWSASchools in lockdown and boy in
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough pupils still cannot leave St
OL,7,FPeter's High School alone, parents have
OL,8,Fnow been told they can collect their
OL,9,Fchildren. Nearby Willow Primary Academy
OL,10,Fremains in full lockdown.
